          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">During this unit's Move step, if this unit would Advance, you may instead'Warp Tunnel'. If you do, select any point in the battlefield and draw a straight line between this unit and the selected point. Then, this unit suffers XD3 SW where X is the number of different units or terrain pieces along that line. Then, remove this unit from the battlefield and place it into reserves. Then, Deploy this unit within 1" of the selected point.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
